<title>NORWAY: NORDIC SKIING-NORWAY WIN MEN'S RELAY GOLD.</title>
<headline>NORDIC SKIING-NORWAY WIN MEN'S RELAY GOLD.</headline>
<dateline>TRONDHEIM, Norway 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway won gold in the</p>
<p>men's 4x10-km cross-country relay at the Nordic skiing world</p>
<p>championships in a provisional time of one hour 37 minutes 06.10</p>
<p>seconds on Friday.</p>
<p>Finland took silver 2:11.20 behind and Italy took bronze</p>
<p>2:50.80 behind the winners, according to unofficial results.</p>
</text>
